# The item form typed in order: Tab passes Parent, Created and Updated,
# which cannot be changed, so a date typed after the location goes to
# Acquired; a value entered by Tab shows selected and what is typed
# replaces it (a new item's Quantity 1 becomes 2, item 2's Maker Tandon
# becomes Shugart), while Left first edits it in place (item 2's Model
# TM100-2 becomes TM100-x2).  Both saved; the list shows them.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T N
T SYS
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
S QTYSEL
T 2
K TAB
T B2
K TAB
S ACQ
T 1999-05-12
S TYPED
K CTRL-S
S ADDED
K ALT-I
T I
K DOWN ENTER CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB
S MAKERSEL
T Shugart
K TAB LEFT
T x
S EDITED
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K ESC F3
T Y
